{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tower_hardwood","model_identifier":"tower_hardwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tower_hardwood\n\nHardwood tower: a 3 x 3 column platform for ranged units, with a parapet and four standing points (`slot_tower_1..4`), a ladder or stair door at the back.\n\nPatch 5: the roof and its posts were raised 12 u (roof underside at y 188) so the four men standing on the deck at y 124 have headroom.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 3 columns (48 x 48 units, 1.35 x 1.35 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -32..32, y 0..212, z -32..32 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 42, construction_0 28, construction_33 40, construction_66 54, ruined 29 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `tower_hardwood_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 200 x 48 centred at the origin\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, 36)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-12, 124, -12)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (12, 124, -12)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-12, 124, 12)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (12, 124, 12)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"log_leg0#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24,0,-24],"to":[-18,140,-18],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,6,140],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[6,0,12,140],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[12,0,18,140],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,0,24,140],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[266,183,272,189],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[272,183,278,189],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8e2c87a5-76a4-5c42-9193-8bbaf335199c"},{"name":"log_leg1#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[18,0,-24],"to":[24,140,-18],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,0,30,140],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[30,0,36,140],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[36,0,42,140],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[42,0,48,140],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[278,183,284,189],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[284,183,290,189],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"49e95d0d-980a-5462-8ce7-619b3b1e0a50"},{"name":"log_leg2#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24,0,18],"to":[-18,140,24],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[48,0,54,140],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[54,0,60,140],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[60,0,66,140],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[66,0,72,140],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[290,183,296,189],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[296,183,302,189],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ea836770-4ec2-5361-9ca7-3ba86be56504"},{"name":"log_leg3#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[18,0,18],"to":[24,140,24],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[72,0,78,140],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78,0,84,140],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[84,0,90,140],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[90,0,96,140],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[302,183,308,189],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[308,183,314,189],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"89c4a539-32fb-5b